          "date": "2026-10-30 04:00:59.000000000",
          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-20879 obdclass: add a helper to classify the object mode",
        "message": "LU-20879 obdclass: add a helper to classify the object mode\n\nAdd dt_mode_is_valid() and return a distinct DFT_INVALID from\ndt_mode_to_dft() for a mode whose type is not a known file type, so\nthe object mode can be classified in one place.  dt_declare_create()\nand dt_create() return an error for an object format of an\nunrecognized type.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-4.8 ltvm,llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I1e7c2106f237de72a58c2170bae8febd833ebbe5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
